+### 4.3 list_conversations
+
+Requests a page of conversation summaries for the user authenticated on this connection. The frame has no user id; `limit`, when present, is an integer from 1 through 200, and `before`, when present, is a cursor with an ISO `updatedAt` and `sessionId` ([validated by: accepts a paged list frame and delivers only the authenticated user’s newest ISO summaries](../../src/transport/ws/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L61), [validated by: rejects invalid paging fields by name while accepting the frame without options](../../src/transport/ws/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L112)).
